'''Grimy Lizards''' are [[slayer monsters]] that require level 44 [[Slayer]] to kill, who are found in the Streambound Cavern within [[Neypotzli]] and the [[Tonali Cavern]]. They can be killed as part of a lizard Slayer task.

Unlike [[desert lizard]]s, grimy lizards do not require [[ice cooler]]s to finish off, nor are special footwear required like for [[sulphur lizard]]s; however, they are [[poison]]ous, and partial completion of the [[Perilous Moons]] quest is required. While quest completion isn't necessary, the room remains instanced until progressing further in the quest. If the lizards do not re-spawn, travel to another part of the dungeon and return.

Grimy lizards have -2 [[flat armour]], so all successful hits will do an extra 2 damage to them. This incentivises using faster weapons, or weapons with [[Multi-hit weapons|multiple hitsplats]], such as the [[sulphur blades]] or the [[dual macuahuitl]].

